Bind shared journal entries to an allowlisted, verified client certificate DN.
The authenticated-source mode rejects other input paths and overwrites all
sender-supplied copies of the receiver-owned _GHAF_SOURCE field.
Enforce configured file age and retention using native rotation and vacuuming,
including during idle periods, in the receiver's event loop.

